& [SJS]
  + Situation: catalogue semantics are formed but no executable closed data waist prevents later derivation or routing from inventing incompatible shapes
  + Justification: pure forms and fail-closed validators stabilize identity boundaries before any package or candidate behavior exists
  + Solution: implement only strict machine records canonical digests fixtures structural and semantic validators and adversarial tests

& [Delineation]
  + representation validation is inside while catalogue derivation lookup traversal ranking execution and effects are outside
  + digest equality proves byte commitment rather than source authority truth or applicability
  + typed local association values retain channel semantics and contain no authority evidence-confidence risk or cost conflation
  + priority validation checks declared lattice consistency and does not decide real relevance

& [DataDrivenDesign]
  + reuse existing SemanticId ContentDigest UnitKind RelationType and source-anchor identity vocabulary
  + use closed enums bounded integers deterministic ordered collections and explicit absence
  + fixtures exercise one identity one operation one applicability seam multiple association channels ambiguity boundary account and proof
  + mutations target every cross-record root address channel tier order bound and digest seam

& [FacultyReview]
  + Honesty requires exact labels for value semantics and prevents score laundering
  + Security requires closed forms bounded values exact roots digests and explicit resolution claims
  + Weaver may represent candidate seams but cannot admit them
  + Planner may represent ordered priority and budgets but cannot execute a search
  + Refiner bounds form sizes and result projections
  + Scribe provides stable serialization and digest commitment
  + Observer validates the whole fixture or returns a typed fault

& [Decision]
  + activate one isolated cantor_core module export fixtures validators canonical digest and focused tests
  + require solution proof workspace tests warnings-denied lint format recursive evidence and rollback record before completion
  + keep Slice2 and all provider persistence learned remote effect FPGA and Minecraft behavior locked
